      "text": "Missed the deadline? The program stays locked. Picking a new round would let\nthe operator choose after seeing output, so it is never automated.",
      "originalText": "Missed the deadline? The program stays locked. Picking a new round would let\nthe operator choose after seeing output, so it is never automated.",
