      "updated": 1792843400000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Judge sandbox timing: round due 45 s after the close, freeze at least 15 s before\nit. Production: close + 3 h and N − 30 min. Demo time only moves the sandbox's own\ndeadlines.",
      "originalText": "Judge sandbox timing: round due 45 s after the close, freeze at least 15 s before\nit. Production: close + 3 h and N − 30 min. Demo time only moves the sandbox's own\ndeadlines.",
